   "5 km exclusion around aerodrome movement areas; 30 m from non-participating persons",
   "UIN registration required; Remote Pilot Licence for flights above 100 m or in controlled airspace",
   "Operations above 2 kg or 400 ft may need CAAN, MoHA and MoCTCA approval"
